    "detailed_description": "Welcome to &quot;Undead City,&quot; a pulse-pounding first-person shooter set in a world devastated by a global pandemic. Humanity's last stand unfolds in this action-packed FPS where you must navigate a post-apocalyptic city swarming with relentless zombies.<br><br>Key Features:<br><br>Intense Combat: Engage in heart-racing battles against hordes of undead. Use a variety of weapons and strategies to survive.<br>Challenging Missions: Take on missions that test your survival skills. From scavenging for supplies to defending critical points, every decision matters.<br>Dynamic Environment: Explore a detailed city environment that reacts to your actions. Use the surroundings to your advantage, setting traps and finding vantage points.<br>Early Access Experience: Join the development journey! Your feedback will help shape the future of &quot;Undead City.&quot; Enjoy regular updates with new features, bug fixes, and improvements.<br>Community Driven: Connect with other survivors on our Steam Community page and share your experiences, tips, and feedback.<br><br>Join the Fight for Survival:<br>Can you withstand the waves of undead? &quot;Undead City&quot; challenges you to survive in a world where every moment is a battle for survival. Gear up, stay vigilant, and fight your way through the chaos.<br><br>Download now and become part of the &quot;Undead City&quot; community!<br><br>",
